{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>I know, my son, I know.</b> That he is the firstborn." "<b>He too shall become a people, and he too shall be great.</b> For Gideon is destined to come forth from him — the Holy One, blessed be He, performs a miracle through him." "<b>But his younger brother shall be greater than he.</b> For Joshua is destined to come forth from him — he will apportion the Land and teach Torah to Israel." "<b>And his seed shall fill the nations.</b> The whole world will be filled when his fame and his name go forth, when he makes the sun stand still in Gibeon and the moon in the Valley of Aijalon."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 48, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:03:58.591853472Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}